  "answer": "Found in the arXiv Help section (https://info.arxiv.org/help/) under 'Email subscriptions for new papers' (https://info.arxiv.org/help/subscribe.html): arXiv offers 'Subscribe to daily listing emails' - regular daily listings of abstracts of new submissions sent by email. To subscribe for a SPECIFIC category (subject class), send an email to the archive address (e.g. physics@arxiv.org or q-fin@arxiv.org) with 'Subject: subscribe <Your Full Name>' and body lines 'add <Category Name>' (or the short subject-class code, e.g. 'add Biophysics' or 'add RM' for q-fin.RM). For archives not subdivided into subject classes, email arch-ive@arxiv.org with 'Subject: subscribe Your Full Name'. Unsubscribe anytime with 'Subject: cancel'.",
